{"seq":2,"slug":"edge-orchestration-scheduling","title":"边缘编排与调度机制：Kubernetes 下沉与联邦","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/edge-cloud-platform-infrastructure/near-user-compute-scheduling/edge-orchestration-scheduling","wordCount":2592,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"边缘编排与调度机制-kubernetes-下沉与联邦\">边缘编排与调度机制：Kubernetes 下沉与联邦</h1><p>一家跨境电商把秒杀风控和图片压缩放到 40 个城市边缘节点上跑。运维沿用云上习惯 <code>kubectl apply</code>，第一次丢包就翻车：某站点与区域控制面断联 8 分钟，Kubelet 心跳上报不上，被 Node Controller 判定 <code>NotReady</code> 触发驱逐，Pod 全被删光。问题不在 Kubernetes 不好用，而在<strong>原生 Kubernetes 的默认假设——&quot;控制面与节点始终有稳定的高带宽连接&quot;——在边缘是错的</strong>。本文回答：Kubernetes 下沉到边缘时编排层要怎么改，多个边缘集群之间又如何用联邦统一调度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"原生-kubernetes-在边缘站点失效的三个根因\">原生 Kubernetes 在边缘站点失效的三个根因</h2><p>根因不是性能，而是三条被边缘环境直接违反的<strong>控制面假设</strong>。</p>\n<p>其一，<strong>心跳与驱逐假设</strong>。默认 Node Lease 租约 40 秒、宽限 40 秒（<code>nodeLeaseDurationSeconds</code> / <code>nodeMonitorGracePeriod</code>），断联超阈值即触发 Pod 驱逐。边缘走 4G/宽带回传，抖动是常态，该机制会把&quot;瞬断&quot;放大成&quot;服务中断&quot;。</p>\n<p>其二是<strong>API Server 可达性假设</strong>。Kubelet、Kube-proxy、CNI 都直连 <code>kube-apiserver</code>。边缘到区域控制面的 RTT 常在 20–80ms 且链路可能中断，直连式控制在断联时完全不可用。</p>\n<p>其三，<strong>调度一次性假设</strong>。<code>IgnoredDuringExecution</code> 语义意味着放置只在调度那一刻生效，节点标签或负载变化后不会自动修正——这与就近算力所需的&quot;随用户位置漂移重放置&quot;天然冲突（该冲突的延迟预算视角见<a href=\"latency-aware-placement-model\">延迟预算驱动的就近算力放置模型</a>）。</p>\n<p>对策分两类：<strong>让节点不必直连控制面</strong>（下沉型），以及<strong>让多个控制面之间的调度统一</strong>（联邦型）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-下沉解决-单站点可用-联邦解决-多站点协同\">核心概念：下沉解决&quot;单站点可用&quot;，联邦解决&quot;多站点协同&quot;</h2><p>下沉与联邦是两个正交问题，混为一谈是常见设计错误。<strong>下沉</strong>处理同一集群内控制面与远端节点的连接与自治：回答&quot;站点断联时本地还能不能跑&quot;。<strong>联邦</strong>处理多个集群之上的统一编排：回答&quot;几十上百个站点的集群谁来统一分发和重放置&quot;。前者关键指标是断联时的本地存活时间，后者是集群间的收敛与故障转移时间；二者技术栈与 SLA 都不同，后续分别展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"两条下沉路线-非侵入代理-vs-云边协同\">两条下沉路线：非侵入代理 vs 云边协同</h2><p><strong>OpenYurt 走&quot;非侵入&quot;路线</strong>，被定位为业内第一个对云原生系统非侵入的边缘计算平台（<a href=\"https://openyurt.io/docs/\">openyurt.io</a>）。核心是每个边缘节点上的 <strong>YurtHub</strong>——位于 Kubelet/Kube-proxy/用户 Pod 与云上 <code>kube-apiserver</code> 之间的本地代理，带本地存储缓存控制面状态，可做可编程数据过滤。常态走标准 K8s 流程，断联时组件用缓存状态继续工作，避免 Pod 驱逐并支持重启恢复。节点按位置分组为 <strong>NodePool</strong>，跨池通信由 <strong>Raven</strong> 承担：每池选一节点作 VPN 网关，池内流量仍走原有 CNI。工作负载层有 <strong>YurtAppSet</strong>（按 NodePool 分发副本）与 <strong>YurtAppDaemon</strong>（在选定 NodePool 各保一份，随池增减自动增删）。当前 v1.7.0，2026-05-06 发布（<a href=\"https://github.com/openyurtio/openyurt/releases\">releases</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>KubeEdge 走&quot;云边协同&quot;路线</strong>。控制面为 <strong>CloudCore</strong>（CloudHub 以 WebSocket 缓存并推送变更；EdgeController 管节点与 Pod 元数据；DeviceController 同步设备状态），边缘侧为 <strong>EdgeCore</strong>（EdgeHub 上报；Edged 管容器；EventBus 提供 MQTT；DeviceTwin 存设备状态；MetaManager 用 SQLite；ServiceBus 让云组件访问边缘 HTTP/REST）（<a href=\"https://kubeedge.io/docs/\">kubeedge.io/docs</a>）。最新 v1.23.1，2026-07-15 发布（<a href=\"https://github.com/kubeedge/kubeedge/releases\">releases</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph Cloud[区域控制面]&#10;        KAS[kube-apiserver]&#10;        YC[CloudCore / EdgeController]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Edge1[NodePool / 站点 A]&#10;        YH1[YurtHub / EdgeHub&lt;br/&gt;本地缓存]&#10;        KB1[Kubelet + Kube-proxy]&#10;        P1[业务 Pod]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Edge2[NodePool / 站点 B]&#10;        YH2[YurtHub / EdgeHub&lt;br/&gt;本地缓存]&#10;        KB2[Kubelet + Kube-proxy]&#10;        P2[业务 Pod]&#10;    end&#10;    KAS --&gt;|下发元数据/work| YC&#10;    YC --&gt;|缓存并推送变更| YH1&#10;    YC --&gt;|缓存并推送变更| YH2&#10;    YH1 --&gt; KB1 --&gt; P1&#10;    YH2 --&gt; KB2 --&gt; P2&#10;    YH1 -.-&gt;|断联时用本地缓存| KB1&#10;    YH2 -.-&gt;|Raven 跨池 VPN| YH1\">graph TD\n    subgraph Cloud[区域控制面]\n        KAS[kube-apiserver]\n        YC[CloudCore / EdgeController]\n    end\n    subgraph Edge1[NodePool / 站点 A]\n        YH1[YurtHub / EdgeHub&lt;br/&gt;本地缓存]\n        KB1[Kubelet + Kube-proxy]\n        P1[业务 Pod]\n    end\n    subgraph Edge2[NodePool / 站点 B]\n        YH2[YurtHub / EdgeHub&lt;br/&gt;本地缓存]\n        KB2[Kubelet + Kube-proxy]\n        P2[业务 Pod]\n    end\n    KAS --&gt;|下发元数据/work| YC\n    YC --&gt;|缓存并推送变更| YH1\n    YC --&gt;|缓存并推送变更| YH2\n    YH1 --&gt; KB1 --&gt; P1\n    YH2 --&gt; KB2 --&gt; P2\n    YH1 -.-&gt;|断联时用本地缓存| KB1\n    YH2 -.-&gt;|Raven 跨池 VPN| YH1</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>OpenYurt（v1.7.0）</th>\n<th>KubeEdge（v1.23.1）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>对 K8s 改动</td>\n<td>非侵入，组件原样保留</td>\n<td>重造云边通道，边缘独立 agent</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边缘侧核心</td>\n<td>YurtHub 代理 + 本地缓存</td>\n<td>EdgeHub/Edged/MetaManager 组合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨站点网络</td>\n<td>Raven VPN 网关，池内走原 CNI</td>\n<td>EdgeMesh / 云边隧道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设备接入</td>\n<td>YurtIoTDock 对接 EdgeX Foundry</td>\n<td>DeviceTwin + EventBus（MQTT 原生）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用画像</td>\n<td>存量 K8s 想平滑加边缘</td>\n<td>强 IoT/MQTT、弱网确定性场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选择逻辑直接：存量标准 K8s 工作负载多选 OpenYurt；设备协议重、站点网络差且需强自治语义选 KubeEdge。</p>\n<h2 id=\"边缘自治与隧道化数据面\">边缘自治与隧道化数据面</h2><p>&quot;边缘自治&quot;（edge autonomy）是两条路线共同的硬需求：<strong>控制面断联时站点仍按最近一次可用状态继续运行</strong>。OpenYurt 靠 YurtHub 本地缓存——断联期间 Kubelet、KubeProxy、用户 Pod 均读缓存状态，从而阻止边缘 Pod 被驱逐（<a href=\"https://openyurt.io/docs/\">openyurt.io/docs</a>）；KubeEdge 靠 EdgeCore 在边缘持久化元数据（MetaManager 用 SQLite），断联本地继续、恢复补报。</p>\n<p>自治的<strong>一致性代价</strong>必须显式管理：断联期间云上是&quot;陈旧视图&quot;，冲突变更需在恢复后消解（工程上取&quot;云为准、边缘补报观测为准&quot;）。这条约束建模为<strong>状态收敛时间</strong>而非强一致：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>converge</mtext></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>partition</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>resync</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{converge}} \\le T_{\\text{partition}} + T_{\\text{resync}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">converge</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">partition</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">resync</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它决定了&quot;站点能容忍多长断联&quot;，是边缘编排最该写进 SLA 的数字。</p>\n<p>弱网还要求控制面通道<strong>复用为隧道</strong>：云上组件需主动访问边缘 HTTP/REST 服务时，KubeEdge 用 ServiceBus 承接，OpenYurt 依赖 Raven 与 YurtHub 透明代理。电商常见用途是让区域中心风控服务经隧道拉起边缘本地推理做实时校验，省去回中心的往返。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多集群联邦-从单点下沉到全局编排\">多集群联邦：从单点下沉到全局编排</h2><p>边缘铺到几十上百个城市后，单集群不再够用——几十个站点的控制面与 etcd 是爆炸半径巨大的单点。此时需<strong>多集群联邦</strong>：每站点一个轻量集群，由上层统一调度。<strong>Karmada</strong>（CNCF 孵化）用 Kubernetes 原生 API 在多集群与多云间运行应用，提供集群亲和、多集群切分与再均衡、跨地域/可用区/集群/厂商的高可用，以及跨集群自动扩缩、故障转移与负载均衡（<a href=\"https://karmada.io/docs/\">karmada.io/docs</a>）。稳定版 v1.19.0，2026-08-31 发布（<a href=\"https://github.com/karmada-io/karmada/releases\">releases</a>）。</p>\n<p>联邦调度可概括为<strong>两层策略 + 一类资源绑定</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>PropagationPolicy</strong>：声明&quot;把哪些资源分发到哪些集群&quot;，用 <code>placement.clusterAffinity</code>（按 <code>region</code>/<code>zone</code>/<code>provider</code>/自定义标签选集群）与 <code>spread</code>（打散约束）表达放置意图，思路与单集群的拓扑打散同源，只是拓扑域从&quot;节点&quot;升到&quot;集群&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>OverridePolicy</strong>：声明&quot;同一应用在不同集群如何差异化&quot;（换镜像 tag、注入本地配置），把&quot;策略统一、实例本地化&quot;拆成两层。</li>\n<li><strong>ResourceBinding / Work</strong>：调度的实际产出。上层产出 ResourceBinding（谁放哪），控制面展开为每目标集群的 Work，由各集群执行组件落地，把&quot;全局意图&quot;翻译为&quot;集群内可执行对象&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>跨区域就近分发的策略骨架（地域亲和 + 打散）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: policy.karmada.io/v1alpha1&#10;kind: PropagationPolicy&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: live-comment-api&#10;spec:&#10;  resourceSelectors:&#10;    - apiVersion: apps/v1&#10;      kind: Deployment&#10;      name: live-comment-api&#10;  placement:&#10;    clusterAffinity:&#10;      labelSelector:&#10;        matchLabels:&#10;          tier: edge-metro # 只落到边缘都会区集群&#10;    spread:&#10;      spreadByField: region # 按地域打散，避免全押一个 region&#10;      maxGroups: 6\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">policy.karmada.io/v1alpha1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">PropagationPolicy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">live-comment-api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  resourceSelectors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">apps/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Deployment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">live-comment-api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  placement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    clusterAffinity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      labelSelector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        matchLabels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          tier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">edge-metro</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 只落到边缘都会区集群</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    spread</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      spreadByField</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">region</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 按地域打散，避免全押一个 region</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      maxGroups</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>跨集群故障转移</strong>依赖健康探测与 <code>clusterAffinity</code> 动态更新：某站点集群 <code>NotReady</code> 时，其上负载按策略重放置到相邻集群。注意联邦故障转移<strong>不等于</strong>边缘自治——前者解决&quot;集群整体不可用时的重放置&quot;（分钟级），后者解决&quot;站点断联时本地不停机&quot;（秒级），是互补的两个时间尺度，不能互相替代。</p>\n<h2 id=\"调度器扩展-把拓扑与时延编进打分函数\">调度器扩展：把拓扑与时延编进打分函数</h2><p>联邦决定&quot;放到哪个集群&quot;，集群内调度器决定&quot;放到哪个节点&quot;。原生 <code>kube-scheduler</code> 的扩展点（<code>NodeResourcesFit</code>、<code>TopologySpread</code>、<code>InterPodAffinity</code>）之外，可通过 <strong>scheduler extender</strong> 或自研插件注入时延代价，把<a href=\"latency-aware-placement-model\">延迟预算模型</a>的可行集判据变成打分函数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>T</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mtext>pred</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>Util</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>Cost</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Score}(n) = w_1 \\cdot \\hat{T}_{\\text{pred}}(n) + w_2 \\cdot \\text{Util}(n) + w_3 \\cdot \\text{Cost}(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2329em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pred</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Util</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cost</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>T</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mtext>pred</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{T}_{\\text{pred}}(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2329em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pred</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是由节点标签编码的地理/网络层级与实时探针共同估计的预测时延，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Util</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Util}(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Util</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是利用率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Cost</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Cost}(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cost</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是资源单价。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 主导&quot;就近&quot;，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 抑制热点，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 抑制成本膨胀。</p>\n<p>对<strong>异构与批量负载</strong>（边缘推荐推理、批量图片处理），<strong>Volcano</strong> 是常用底座：CNCF 官方容器批量调度项目，支持 VolcanoJob 承载 Spark/PyTorch/TensorFlow/Flink/Ray 等框架，提供队列配额、资源借还与回收、抢占、binpacking、DRF，以及 <strong>gang scheduling</strong>（保证作业所有任务同时启动，避免分布式训练部分启动死锁）；异构与拓扑感知上支持 CUDA/MIG 模式 GPU、NPU、vCUDA 与多容器 GPU 共享，并做<strong>网络带宽感知</strong>、task-topology 与 NUMA 感知（<a href=\"https://volcano.sh/en/docs/\">volcano.sh/en/docs</a>）。边缘里 gang 价值突出：边缘 GPU 分散、单站点算力有限，作业要么全起要么全不起，部分启动会长期占用稀缺资源并失败重试。</p>\n<h2 id=\"生产落地的判断清单\">生产落地的判断清单</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>先定自治时长，再选项目。</strong> 站点可接受的最长断联时间是硬约束，决定本地缓存规模与重同步窗口；把它写进 SLA，而非默认&quot;网络总是好的&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>驱逐参数按边缘网络调。</strong> 默认 40 秒宽限对抖动链路过严，应结合回传质量放宽，或靠自治机制在断联时豁免驱逐。</li>\n<li><strong>两级拓扑域映射两级集群。</strong> 单集群用 <code>topology.kubernetes.io/metro</code> 类标签表达&quot;离用户近&quot;，联邦层用 <code>clusterAffinity</code> + <code>spread</code> 表达&quot;跨都会区打散&quot;，不要把全局打散硬塞进单集群的高基数拓扑域。</li>\n<li><strong>联邦故障转移与边缘自治分属不同时间尺度。</strong> 本地不停机靠自治（秒级），集群重放置靠联邦（分钟级），二者都要有，不可互相顶替。</li>\n<li><strong>异构/批量负载用 Volcano 类调度补位。</strong> gang、DRF、网络拓扑感知交给专门的批量调度层。</li>\n<li><strong>跟踪版本兼容。</strong> 边缘项目迭代快，升级前确认与集群 Kubernetes 版本的兼容矩阵。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>边缘编排是<strong>三层</strong>协同：节点级的非侵入/协同下沉保证单站点断联可用，集群级的联邦编排保证多站点统一分发与重放置，节点内的拓扑与时延感知调度保证请求落到真正就近且不过载的节点。任一层缺失，都会在真实弱网与规模化下暴露问题。落地第一步往往不是选项目，而是先确定<strong>断联容忍时长</strong>与<strong>故障转移目标时长</strong>——它们反过来决定技术栈。</p>\n<p>延伸阅读：站点拓扑与选址的物理约束见<a href=\"../edge-platform-architecture/pop-site-node-topology\">边缘站点与节点拓扑</a>；云边数据面的带宽与回传设计见<a href=\"../edge-platform-architecture/edge-network-dataplane-backhaul\">边缘网络数据面与回传</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"边缘编排与调度机制：Kubernetes 下沉与联邦","id":"边缘编排与调度机制-kubernetes-下沉与联邦"},{"level":2,"text":"原生 Kubernetes 在边缘站点失效的三个根因","id":"原生-kubernetes-在边缘站点失效的三个根因"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：下沉解决\"单站点可用\"，联邦解决\"多站点协同\"","id":"核心概念-下沉解决-单站点可用-联邦解决-多站点协同"},{"level":2,"text":"两条下沉路线：非侵入代理 vs 云边协同","id":"两条下沉路线-非侵入代理-vs-云边协同"},{"level":2,"text":"边缘自治与隧道化数据面","id":"边缘自治与隧道化数据面"},{"level":2,"text":"多集群联邦：从单点下沉到全局编排","id":"多集群联邦-从单点下沉到全局编排"},{"level":2,"text":"调度器扩展：把拓扑与时延编进打分函数","id":"调度器扩展-把拓扑与时延编进打分函数"},{"level":2,"text":"生产落地的判断清单","id":"生产落地的判断清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"延迟预算驱动的就近算力放置模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/edge-cloud-platform-infrastructure/near-user-compute-scheduling/latency-aware-placement-model"},"next":{"title":"边云协同与工作负载卸载策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/edge-cloud-platform-infrastructure/near-user-compute-scheduling/edge-cloud-workload-offload"}}